Package: knappnet
Title: Fast, Validated Network Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Conway", "Knapp", email = "knapply@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Network analysis on networks represented as a pair of data
    frames, one for nodes and one for edges. Algorithms run in a compiled,
    multithreaded engine and every measure is validated against established
    reference implementations. Betweenness uses the algorithm of Brandes
    (2001) <doi:10.1080/0022250X.2001.9990249> and the triad census uses the
    algorithm of Batagelj and Mrvar (2001)
    <doi:10.1016/S0378-8733(01)00035-1>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/knapply/knappnet
BugReports: https://github.com/knapply/knappnet/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    igraph,
    sna
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.70), GNU make
